---

<section class="py-24 bg-[#006581]">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-serif text-white mb-6">
      Saúde baseada em evidência e respeito à vida.
    </h2>
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center">
      <a
        href="https://wa.me/554891203870?text=Ol%C3%A1!%20Gostaria%20de%20saber%20mais%20sobre%20Medicina%20Integrativa."
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        onclick="gtag_report_conversion()"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-white text-[#006581] font-bold px-10 py-4 rounded-full hover:bg-opacity-90 transition-all shadow-lg"
      >
        Falar no WhatsApp
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M7 7h10v10" />
          <path d="M7 17 17 7" />
        </svg>
      </a>
      <a
        href="#"
        class="text-white/80 hover:text-white underline text-sm"
